<package name="oniux" project="openSUSE:Factory">
  <title>oniux</title>
  <description>**This is still considered experimental software!**

*oniux* is a tool that utilizes various Linux `namespaces(7)` in order to isolate an arbitrary application over the Tor network. To achieve this, it makes heavy use of the onionmasq, which offers a TUN device to send Tor traffic through.</description>
  <url>https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/core/oniux</url>
</package>
